---
import AppShell from '../layouts/AppShell.astro';
---
<AppShell title="License" section="License"><div class="page-title"><div><h1>License & subscription</h1><p>Current tier, entitlements, and installation details.</p></div><button class="btn">Import license file</button></div><div class="two-col"><div class="stack"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>Current tier</h2><span class="pill success">active</span></div><div class="card-body"><div class="kpi-value">Free</div><p>Everything for a single developer is included.</p><p class="muted">Local projects and jobs, providers, approvals, budgets, and audit history.</p></div></section><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>Entitlements</h2></div><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable table"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>Capability</th><th>Free</th><th>Team</th><th>Business</th></tr></thead><tbody>{[['Local developer','Included','Included','Included'],['Projects','Unlimited','Unlimited','Unlimited'],['Multi-user roles','—','Included','Included'],['Org policy locks','—','—','Included'],['Audit export','Local','Included','Included']].map(row=><tr>{row.map(cell=><td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section></div><div class="stack"><section class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>License details</h2></div><table class="key-values"><tbody><tr><th>Licensee</th><td>Local installation</td></tr><tr><th>Seats</th><td>1</td></tr><tr><th>Expiry</th><td>None</td></tr><tr><th>Installation ID</th><td class="mono">tf-local-7c41…e2a8 <button class="btn small" data-copy="tf-local-7c41-e2a8">Copy</button></td></tr></tbody></table></section><div class="notice"><strong>AI provider costs are separate</strong><p>Providers bill their own API or subscription usage. Those costs are not part of the Turtle Flow license.</p></div></div></div></AppShell>
